Description: Add Arcified read-only macOS static signature verification
 Issue: https://github.com/Timpan4/helium-arcified/issues/133
 This mechanism accepts explicit owner-approved identity/requirement inputs.
 It does not select signing infrastructure or prove notarization/installation.
 Prepared against Chromium 155.0.8059.79 downstream source; see source-identities.json.

